          <a href="#tips" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">9. Getting the Most From It</a>
          <a href="#bedrooms" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">10. For Bedrooms</a>
